          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwe ensi Babilonia, weekuluntaza inho. Kale ni, nze Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye ndidha kukukolaku. Ekiseera kituuse nze nkubonereze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe ensi eyeekuluntaza, olyekontola waagwa aye ghaabulagho n'omuntu alikuyamba okusitukagho. Ebibuga byo ndibikunaaniaku omuliro, gwazikiriza ebintu byonabyona ebyezungulwire agho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
