          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kwol 18:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kale ni ekibuga Babiloni kiribangamu bisolo bya mu irungu, na mpiti, na nhonhi dhitali nongoofu. Tikiriirayo kabiri kubaamu bantu mu biseera byakyo byonabyona eby'omu maiso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24+GEN.19.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mainh 19:24-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nga bwe nazikiriza Sodoma, ni Gomorra, aghalala n'ebibuga ebyali agho okumpi nabyo, n'ekibuga Babiloni ntyo bwe ndikizikiriza, kyaloba kwiramu kubangamu bantu. Nze Musengwa Katonda, ninze nkobye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'empologoma bw'evaayo mu kibira ekizibirivu ekiri ku mbali kw'omwiga Yorudani n'eja n'erumba ebyayiro by'ensolo ebirungi, zeena, nze Musengwa Katonda, ntyo bwendiidha okuzindula Abababilonia, balumuke bave mu kibuga kyaibwe. Olwo omuntu ye ndirondagho n'alifuga eighanga eryo. Naani asobola okwegeza ku nze? Naani asobola okuneesonsaaku? Era mufuzi ki asobola okuntakania? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni muwulire kye ntegeike okukola ku kibuga Babiloni, akabi ke neesoomeire okutuusa ku bantu baakyo. Ni bwe baba abaana baibwe, abazigu balibakwekwebya baabatwala, era abantu boonaboona balitya inho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babiloni bwe kirigwa, omuvuuma guliba gwa maani inho n'ensi yoonayoona yaatengeeta. Era okulira kw'abantu baakyo kulija ghala inho kwatuuka ni mu maghanga goonagoona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
